566
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:10,060
Hmm?

567
00:26:10,060 --> 00:26:11,560
Blue.

568
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:14,360
Ah, ah, blue, red, blue.

569
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:17,160
