581
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,320
No.

582
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:47,640
Hmm.

583
00:26:47,640 --> 00:26:48,480
Ah.

584
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:49,560
Uh.

585
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:50,520
B.

586
00:26:50,520 --> 00:26:52,640
