587
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:54,080
No.

588
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:54,640
Nothing.

589
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:55,440
No wire?

590
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:57,160
No wire.

591
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:59,070
Hmm.

592
00:26:59,070 --> 00:27:02,440
It's pitch black! Pitch black! Pitch black!

593
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:10,940
This is... well, it's tough. It's tough! The best option is to cut the wire connected to A or C.

594
00:27:10,940 --> 00:27:29,840
Yeah yeah yeah yeah. Okay so for now, cut the wire connected to B. Something. Something. There's no B wire! None! None! What?! B is... none, none, none! 1A, 1A, 2A, 3C!

595
00:27:29,840 --> 00:27:51,330
Don't cut anything on the panel — press the next arrow button.

596
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:53,330
Next!

597
00:28:19,530 --> 00:28:26,590
The first one connected... there was a B something.

598
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:33,470
A... circle...

599
00:28:33,470 --> 00:28:41,030
Okay, I think we're finally getting somewhere — okay, that's fine.

600
00:28:41,030 --> 00:28:42,100
Yes!

601
00:28:42,100 --> 00:28:51,180
Four, five, C, six, C, six, two, C, black wire.

602
00:28:51,180 --> 00:28:52,240
Three!

603
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:53,090
Black?

604
00:28:53,090 --> 00:28:54,840
Black!

605
00:28:54,840 --> 00:28:57,640
The three connected to black — cut it!

606
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,440
Alright!

607
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,440
Next!

608
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,240
Here we go!

609
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:01,240
Okay okay okay!

610
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:06,450
Seven, C, red, eight, A.

611
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:07,440
Black!

612
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,440
Nine, C, black!

613
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:11,240
Black!

614
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:16,900
We died!

615
00:29:16,900 --> 00:29:18,700
