637
00:30:01,100 --> 00:30:04,100
Ignoring the character overlap, the fennec has been reborn!

638
00:30:04,100 --> 00:30:05,900
The fennec is back!

639
00:30:05,900 --> 00:30:06,740
Yes!

640
00:30:06,740 --> 00:30:07,700
Yes!

641
00:30:07,700 --> 00:30:14,720
So, first of all, as a premise — Coco-kaichou doesn't have her own stream going, she's reading the manual and talking to me.

642
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:18,240
She's reading the manual and giving me instructions.

643
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:21,060
It's already been 30 minutes and you're just now saying that?

644
00:30:21,060 --> 00:30:28,290
I know, I know, yes, yes, sorry, that, that, that—

645
00:30:28,290 --> 00:30:32,150
She successfully demonstrated the power to make her junior wet herself—

646
00:30:32,150 --> 00:30:36,150
