647
00:30:36,150 --> 00:30:36,870
Senpai, I leaked!

648
00:30:37,490 --> 00:30:38,950
Wear a diaper then!

649
00:30:38,950 --> 00:30:39,950
Whaaaat?!

650
00:30:39,950 --> 00:30:43,750
Geez! That's why you greenhorns are hopeless!

651
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:46,590
I always wore a diaper until I could handle it as a junior!

652
00:30:46,590 --> 00:30:47,550
You guys!

653
00:30:47,550 --> 00:30:50,350
I'm a woman who comes prepared!

654
00:30:50,350 --> 00:30:52,950
Wait, you were wearing a diaper this whole time? Y-yes!

655
00:30:52,950 --> 00:30:53,950
Of course!

656
00:30:53,950 --> 00:30:57,750
If a greenhorn like you had heard the instructions beforehand—

657
00:30:57,750 --> 00:30:59,750
Hold the blue button!

658
00:30:59,750 --> 00:31:01,550
Hold the blue button!

659
00:31:01,550 --> 00:31:03,550
I have to hold it?!

660
00:31:03,550 --> 00:31:05,350
That's right...

661
00:31:05,860 --> 00:31:20,590
Blue flash! Blue flash! Blue flash! Blue? Blue! What color is the button? Blue... Huh? Huh? Huh? Because you told me to hold it! Because you told me to hold it! Did you hold it? I'm holding it!

662
00:31:20,590 --> 00:31:26,390
Okay, then refer to releasing a— ah right, let go, let go!

663
00:31:26,390 --> 00:31:29,380
Huh? Huh? When? When? Now?

664
00:31:29,380 --> 00:31:31,190
