2nd place.

699
00:33:19,570 --> 00:33:21,390
Hmm...

700
00:33:21,390 --> 00:33:23,190
Press the 2nd from the left!

701
00:33:23,190 --> 00:33:25,790
The 2nd from the left is 4!

702
00:33:25,790 --> 00:33:27,790
Press it!

703
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:28,590
Press it!

704
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:31,190
