720
00:34:07,590 --> 00:34:09,390
Next!

721
00:34:09,390 --> 00:34:11,390
OK!

722
00:34:11,390 --> 00:34:14,290
3! 3! 3!

723
00:34:14,290 --> 00:34:18,290
