724
00:34:18,290 --> 00:34:20,090
Second from the left!

725
00:34:20,090 --> 00:34:25,250
This is...

726
00:34:25,250 --> 00:34:27,050
This is...

727
00:34:27,050 --> 00:34:28,850
Sadly...

728
00:34:28,850 --> 00:34:31,310
I've lost count of how many times this has happened

729
00:34:31,310 --> 00:34:36,210
Yet another Polka has died in front of everyone, and I've lost count of which one

