Like a puffed-up mochi

754
00:35:44,650 --> 00:35:45,750
OK

755
00:35:45,750 --> 00:35:46,730
And

756
00:35:46,730 --> 00:35:49,750
Something that looks like an N

757
00:35:49,750 --> 00:35:52,290
Something like an N, OK?

758
00:35:52,290 --> 00:35:53,890
Umm...

759
00:35:53,890 --> 00:35:55,590
Umm...

760
00:35:55,590 --> 00:35:58,010
Something like a reversed Ki

761
00:35:58,010 --> 00:36:01,070
Like a mirrored katakana Ki

762
00:36:01,070 --> 00:36:01,550
OK

763
00:36:01,550 --> 00:36:02,590
Press Ki!

764
00:36:02,590 --> 00:36:03,130
Ki

765
00:36:03,130 --> 00:36:03,750
Pressed it

766
00:36:03,750 --> 00:36:04,250
Ki

767
00:36:04,250 --> 00:36:06,150
And next, AE

768
00:36:06,150 --> 00:36:06,670
A

769
00:36:06,670 --> 00:36:08,730
The N-like one

770
00:36:08,730 --> 00:36:09,870
The N-like one

771
00:36:09,870 --> 00:36:10,290
Mochi

772
00:36:10,290 --> 00:36:10,950
Omega

