Yes! Yes!

786
00:36:42,090 --> 00:36:43,890
Cut the second wire!

787
00:36:43,890 --> 00:36:49,850
The yellow wire, second one — cut it? Wait, never mind! Cut the very first wire!

788
00:36:49,850 --> 00:37:04,690
Cut the yellow one? Cut cut cut? Wait, there IS a black wire, right? Yeah, one. Oh, there's one... Cut the first wire! The first wire! Yellow, OK? OK!

789
00:37:04,690 --> 00:37:06,600
Yes! Cut!

790
00:37:32,790 --> 00:37:35,490
6, 5, 6, 5, 4...

791
00:37:35,490 --> 00:37:36,650
