Oh really?

800
00:37:59,890 --> 00:38:01,710
I thought I was saving my kouhai's life!

801
00:38:01,710 --> 00:38:02,610
That's right!

802
00:38:02,610 --> 00:38:05,690
The Chairman saved her junior's life!

803
00:38:05,690 --> 00:38:06,430
Yay!

804
00:38:06,430 --> 00:38:07,710
Alright, I'm heading back to the cabaret club. See ya!

805
00:38:07,710 --> 00:38:08,210
Why?!

806
00:38:08,210 --> 00:38:09,250
Um—

807
00:38:09,250 --> 00:38:10,890
