809
00:38:13,070 --> 00:38:13,570
Oh!

810
00:38:13,570 --> 00:38:16,230
The call was still connected this whole time!

811
00:38:16,230 --> 00:38:16,590
Whoa!

812
00:38:16,590 --> 00:38:17,410
