816
00:38:20,310 --> 00:38:21,430
Let's talk!

817
00:38:21,430 --> 00:38:22,590
Talk! Talk! Talk! Talk!

818
00:38:22,590 --> 00:38:23,810
Talk! Talk!

819
00:38:23,810 --> 00:38:25,490
This Polka sure talks a lot...

820
00:38:25,490 --> 00:38:27,230
Talk! Talk! Talk!

821
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:28,430
Talk! Talk! Talk!

822
00:38:28,430 --> 00:38:29,870
What is it? Go ahead and say it!

823
00:38:29,870 --> 00:38:30,770
First collab!

824
00:38:30,770 --> 00:38:32,610
First collaboration!

825
00:38:32,610 --> 00:38:34,950
And so...

826
00:38:34,950 --> 00:38:35,970
Congratulations!

827
00:38:35,970 --> 00:38:37,050
First collab!

828
00:38:37,050 --> 00:38:40,280
Woo! Polka! Yay!

829
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:42,580
